    <name>Cebu Jeepney Route No. 12D (sign board: TRES)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[more jeepney route maps at cebujeepneys.weebly.com<br><br>NOTE: when going to labangon be sure to look for the sign board that says "TRES", then this is the route map for it.<br><br>Labangon to Colon (from Katipunan St.)<br><br>labangon to colon<br>punta princesa to colon<br>tisa to colon<br>labangon to hiway<br>labangon to south bus terminal<br>labangon to E.Mall<br>labangon to university of san carlos<br>labangon to UV<br>labangon to Cathedral<br>punta princesa to Elizabeth Mall<br>punta princesa to University of San Carlos<br>tisa to e. mall<br>tisa to usc<br>tisa to p.del rosario<br>tisa to junquera st.<br>tisa to cathedral<br><br>Colon to Labangon (via Tres de Abril st.)<br><br>colon to labangon<br>colon to tres de abril labangon<br>colon to punta prinsesa<br>cathedral to colonnade<br>sto.nino to colonnade<br>cathedral to e. mall<br>sto. nino to e. mall<br>cathedral to labangon<br>cathedral to tisa<br>cathedral to punta prinsesa<br>cathedral to ccmc<br>cathedral to citilink <br>colonnade to labangon<br>colonnade to e. mall<br>colonnade to ccmc<br>colonnade to citilink<br>colonnade to tres de abril st.]]></description>
